module examples.err_layout_mmio_wrapper

# plans/M7.md item B: `ReadOnly[T]`/`WriteOnly[T]` are 03-hardware.md §2's
# *register* wrappers. Device-visible memory (`dma`) and persistent bytes
# (`wire`) have no registers, so a wrapper there describes nothing — it is
# rejected rather than quietly treated as the wrapped integer.

@layout(dma, endian=little)
struct Descriptor:
    addr: u64
    len: ReadOnly[u32]
